# route: level=w1_l2_coop difficulty=beginner players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=wipes:0,eggs:0,x2_gates:2,min_checkpoints:6,min_kills:15,max_hurts:1
# w1_l2_coop "Canopy Village" for two - Beginner two-stream route proof (designer DB1, wf10; ticks:P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S;
# recorded from closed-loop duo bots, build/db1/p5/bot_w1_l2.gd). The forest floor: P1 opens the inset spot, the pot
# and the crate; the Shellback by the hut by a pincer (P2 baits, P1 jumps over it and clubs its back). Gate
# 'treehouse': P2 stands on the root mound, P1 lands on his head holding Up (the Shoulder Hop), steers onto the tree
# house deck and clubs the coiled vine down; P2 climbs it. Over the bat gaps and up the branches, P2 a hop behind;
# both ride the diagonal lift and the trunk lift together (the same keys on the same tick). Gate 'shaft': P1 breaks
# the cracked bark, P2 stands under the ledge 8 rows up, P1 shoulder-hops onto it and clubs the coiled vine down; P2
# climbs it and both climb the hanging vine to the trunk top. Down the big branch (P1 clubs the Snatcher bat), the
# village deck (the stinger, a Shellback pincer from the right), the down lift together, the leaper pits crossed in
# their pauses, the snapper and the bats of the row-84 deck, the lowest deck's hopper, and both into the exit totem.
# A waiting hero taps Down now and then (no role is idle 243 ticks). Club only, no S.
